      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. we can flip at most \nk 0's to make most \nconsecutive ones\n\n2. if we are finding\n1's we will just move \non\n\n3. after finding the \nfirst zero , increment\nthe zero count\n\n4. after zero count is \nover k , move the left\npointr\n",
